values ('b4e8a2c6-1d39-4f07-8a52-6c0e3b9d5f17', 'community-public-health-nursing', 'Community/Public Health Nursing', 'Community/Public Health Nursing prepares the BSN learner to improve health with populations and communities across the care continuum. Students use epidemiology, community-engaged assessment, health promotion, equity analysis, policy, environmental health, emergency preparedness, informatics, and evaluation to identify priorities and co-design evidence-informed action. A supervised practicum emphasizes partnership, ethical practice, clear communication, and measurable benefit.');

