ac661c44f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Population-specific considerations", "description": "Applies universal principles while honoring distinct histories and strengths.", "children": [{"id": "f680a832-6a4d-4812-8817-420a9420c69b", "type": "concept", "title": "rural, remote, Indigenous, and tribal communities"}, {"id": "e835ef39-0c38-47e4-a038-8c6d3e5b8c57", "type": "concept", "title": "migrants, refugees, homelessness, and justice involvement"}, {"id": "4a90f721-c27f-4272-83a7-2d744fce1f14", "type": "concept", "title": "LGBTQ+ people and people with disabilities"}]}, {"id": "891ed917-6ee5-4b30-bbdd-8b4837aa7695", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Navigation, outreach, and continuity", "description": "Builds strategies for meeting people where they are.", "children": [{"id": "7a29472b-72da-4684-9070-810d16589dbb", "type": "concept", "title": "home visits, mobile care, street outreach, and telehealth"}, {"id": "7818e852-a79b-4a03-b1ca-3cb66f59538b", "type": "concept", "title": "warm handoffs and trauma-informed referral"}, {"id": "32ca9c67-3d99-448d-a821-e49791809930", "type": "concept", "title": "community health workers and peer support"}]}]}, {"id": "628c6570-e263-4150-bf3b-42dd49ca89e1", "type": "topic", "title": "Program Planning, Implementation, and Evaluation", "description": "Turns community priorities and evidence into feasible interventions and measures implementation, outcomes, equity, and unintended effects.", "children": [{"id": "ec1f1998-88d2-4d40-a7d8-507799960c40", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Needs assessment and program theory", "description": "Explains why an intervention should work, for whom, and under what conditions.", "children": [{"id": "2844f79f-4a1f-4b16-b4d6-ea45a314e72a", "type": "concept", "title": "evidence and contextual fit"}, {"id": "e52ec5d8-e2c6-4e30-9009-482ee550eb20", "type": "concept", "title": "theory of change and logic models"}, {"id": "94a5dc0d-bb14-4922-bf8f-45c44cfab08f", "type": "concept", "title": "SMARTIE objectives and