essibility and family-school coordination"}]}, {"id": "6ff59d38-08d6-476f-badc-1420a9610cce", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Occupational health", "description": "Applies prevention and surveillance to worker health.", "children": [{"id": "86c9fa34-22b3-4389-ac6a-d508408139df", "type": "concept", "title": "hazard identification and exposure control"}, {"id": "86eca480-042a-4d5f-a303-087b14946ef2", "type": "concept", "title": "injury surveillance and return to work"}, {"id": "ab9dc8b2-b1e0-4b01-a5e3-eff7847ced78", "type": "concept", "title": "vaccination, respiratory protection, and wellness"}]}, {"id": "096b2fa5-62f6-4f9f-ad52-603c254500da", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Home, correctional, faith, and agency practice", "description": "Explores relationship-based practice in settings with distinct authority and resources.", "children": [{"id": "ade85ef7-4f26-4430-b7d9-ff9f402f07c0", "type": "concept", "title": "home visiting and family assessment"}, {"id": "904ec21d-fb75-4b31-b953-1d86a4649f31", "type": "concept", "title": "correctional health, re-entry, and continuity"}, {"id": "5cac916d-6a93-40cc-a65c-7e47d1bd6260", "type": "concept", "title": "faith/community organizations and health departments"}]}]}, {"id": "c9b464c5-8ca2-4f2c-b5b6-e227adce01f8", "type": "topic", "title": "Emergency Preparedness, Disaster Nursing, and Humanitarian Response", "description": "Prepares students for all emergency phases with attention to triage, continuity, equity, responder safety, and recovery.", "children": [{"id": "0a6326c5-f480-47b3-bef9-a151a346ad2f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Preparedness and incident management", "description": "Clarifies coordinated, all-hazards roles before an event.", "children": [{"id": "4c3f436c-6fce-47a5-aaa0-43351b012967", "type": "concept", "title": "hazard vulnerability and emergency plans"}, {"id": "dc8803a0-91b2-4145-bcd3-31575593f51d", "type": "concept", "title": "Incident Command System"}, {"id": "3ad16351-6397-494c-90f4-3d0e5046ade0", "type": "concept", "title": "personal readiness, responder safety, and ethical duty"}]}, {"id": "c1360534-e369-4454-a8ba-5f53951212eb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Response and rapid assessment", "description": "Develops reasoning for scarce resources, shifting needs, and incomplete data.", "children": [{"id": "a17a201e-ff62-4460-a9c5-c996244e5416", "type": "concept", "title": "population triage, shelters, dispensing, and evacuation"}, {"id": "ae39e47c-8953-4df9-885f-ab802b53cbbc", "type": "concept", "title": "CASPER and rapid needs assessment"}, {"id": "ca7f208b-f9dd-4935-85c4-f554f77532f9", "type": "concept", "title": "risk communication, rumors, and crisis standards"}]}, {"id": "1852d70b-0fde-4c8a-9826-3091d9cff841", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Recovery and resilience", "description": "Extends nursing beyond the acute phase to equitable rebuilding.", "children": [{"id": "dacd61cc-d349-4681-a1ef-b96602903e0d", "type": "concept", "title": "continuity of medications and essential care"}, {"id": "ce6f0290-0166-4baf-84cd-473fca651512", "type": "concept", "title": "psychological first aid and responder well-being"}, {"id": "9329588f-43e5-4df3-830c-1b156af9e77b", "type": "concept", "title": "after-action review, mitigation, and resilience"}]}]}, {"id": "050e6d7b-d90f-4927-804c-30d6f1e33de5", "type": "topic", "title": "Policy, Law, Ethics, Advocacy, and Financing", "description": "Shows how authority, regulation, budgets, and political choices shape health—and how nurses can influence them ethically.", "children": [{"id": "8a632d35-b016-484c-a714-0602f71216fe", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Law and ethics", "description": "Balances collective benefit, liberty, least restrictive means, reciprocity, and justice.", "children": [{"id": "564241aa-a2df-4bbb-b176-fbeb4c3576a4", "type": "concept", "title": "police powers, quarantine, mandates, and due process"}, {"id": "1c565762-9719-4483-9377-b16213543cd5", "type": "concept", "title": "privacy, reporting, and data sharing"}, {"id": "0c0a3e83-e9c6-422b-ba78-52bc1ae890be", "type": "concept", "title": "scarce resources and ethical frameworks"}]}, {"id": "628dc1e2-2fa4-4b8e-a087-25181bc1a9d6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Policy analysis and financing", "description": "Reads problems, stakeholders, evidence, feasibility, and distributional effects.", "children": [{"id": "38b32bd4-ba1c-4fb9-ae9d-ca31511edf8a", "type": "concept", "title": "agenda setting, implementation, and evaluation"}, {"id": "2aba69d1-abea-4a3c-beca-0e7ed18b008f", "type": "concept", "title": "coverage, public programs, and health finance"}, {"id": "0fde0adb-c047-43d3-a8d3-3b07e53f4c7a", "type": "concept", "title": "health-in-all-policies and impact assessment"}]}, {"id": "cdba071e-78ec-4827-9a29-08c416eb4087", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Nursing advocacy", "description": "Builds concise evidence-informed influence from practice to policy.", "children": [{"id": "2479bc56-33ea-46a2-b628-a516ff8ac34e", "type": "concept", "title": "power mapping and coalitions"}, {"id": "4fbeff3a-f6aa-4c48-93a0-9e301b7d81ba", "type": "concept", "title": "briefs, testimony, media, and policymaker meetings"}, {"id": "a049e34e-da76-47d7-82fa-c9ba16243bd6", "type": "concept", "title": "professional boundaries and advocacy evaluation"}]}]}, {"id": "b1155dc1-cd90-40a6-b1ce-3cf4957af28d", "type": "topic", "title": "Global Health, Informatics, and the Future of Population Nursing", "description": "Integrates global interdependence, digital tools, evidence, and professional responsibility into future-ready practice.", "children": [{"id": "fe717027-81e1-404d-9ca0-bde4ebcdf479", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Global health and decolonizing partnership", "description": "Compares burdens and systems while resisting extractive service models.", "children": [{"id": "73f33bcd-cfc0-4457-b393-cf3a39cc865d", "type": "concept", "title": "global burden, migration, conflict, and security"}, {"id": "8ff08a3f-82b3-4ef1-9e01-16b41a9d95d8", "type": "concept", "title": "universal coverage and primary healthcare"}, {"id": "085892b3-a0a1-472f-ae3d-3a3c0d9fea65", "type": "concept", "title": "reciprocity, local leadership, and sustainability"}]}, {"id": "aabe40a6-72d8-4a8a-9299-cb35e18c19bd", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Informatics and responsible data use", "description": "Uses digital infrastructure without amplifying exclusion or harm.", "children": [{"id": "248909a2-6335-4c90-bc52-94d0aff1679a", "type": "concept", "title": "registries, EHR population data, GIS, and dashboards"}, {"id": "ee4e1e30-5d87-48cc-8dc3-3269959a7f01", "type": "concept", "title": "interoperability, governance, privacy, and cybersecurity"}, {"id": "e21c6d62-9d09-482a-8038-bd48928cf445", "type": "concept", "title": "algorithmic bias, digital divide, and responsible AI"}]}, {"id": "fdbcb588-235a-466c-a201-a935f59fdd7c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evidence translation and formation", "description": "Culminates in continuous learning, communication, and leadership.", "children": [{"id": "1821d40d-0ecf-429a-a565-aa8bf7ce6ed8", "type": "concept", "title": "rapid appraisal and guideline adaptation"}, {"id": "146dc6c3-7cb0-494f-b7e6-c73c593dfc1d", "type": "concept", "title": "knowledge translation for communities and decision makers"}, {"id": "61969099-65f4-40ed-861e-0b09bd624b02", "type": "concept", "title": "reflection, moral resilience, and career pathways"}]}]}], "dbBacked": true}$cphnjson$::jsonb,
