sive teaching and shared decisions.", "children": [{"id": "383f55d4-ef01-41df-abd4-79f344cb6bb2", "type": "concept", "title": "teach-back, plain language, numeracy, and accessibility"}, {"id": "5e41a9d9-5857-4734-a348-0242e34eee60", "type": "concept", "title": "motivational interviewing"}, {"id": "ed34d0a6-67ea-40b8-b020-438faefec7b4", "type": "concept", "title": "misinformation and uncertainty communication"}]}, {"id": "58c32e26-ae70-4883-b5cf-07bc7d078dbb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Life-course prevention", "description": "Links exposures and protection across development to timely action.", "children": [{"id": "9d33cdb2-cd09-40ee-a152-421e755d8d9f", "type": "concept", "title": "immunization and screening"}, {"id": "1f9c93f9-d6c8-4d85-9b11-a9d1e223096c", "type": "concept", "title": "maternal-child through older-adult prevention"}, {"id": "cac990b3-44b9-40b6-a591-0e6e3c2ca879", "type": "concept", "title": "mental health, injury, and violence prevention"}]}]}, {"id": "62bb00f0-13dc-4238-8f01-ec63ffebb2ce", "type": "topic", "title": "Communicable Disease Prevention and Control", "description": "Integrates transmission science, surveillance, nursing assessment, and public health authority while protecting rights.", "children": [{"id": "3b3246ba-0a02-4970-81e0-2e21682e253b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Transmission and prevention", "description": "Connects routes of spread with layered controls.", "children": [{"id": "c774e055-60ca-4569-b2d2-061b8fea48b1", "type": "concept", "title": "chain of infection"}, {"id": "4415238a-e4a9-42d1-a33d-8836809ea875", "type": "concept", "title": "vaccination, prophylaxis, isolation, and quarantine"}, {"id": "dc1e7572-adfc-4f42-9507-2831e71eb670", "type": "concept", "title": "infection prevention in homes, shelters, schools, and workplaces"}]}, {"id": "61124753-9c7f-4233-9b48-b8928f77d81e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Case and contact management", "description": "Develops the workflow used to find cases and interrupt spread.", 