ves and equity indicators"}]}, {"id": "a70df830-8d11-4e2c-be88-261413b2b9db", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Implementation and management", "description": "Translates plans into roles, workflows, resources, timelines, and adaptations.", "children": [{"id": "ca3d0589-994f-44c2-b77d-f6fb1a182fdd", "type": "concept", "title": "implementation strategies"}, {"id": "290de0bb-a4d4-4d1f-a468-0965553ae087", "type": "concept", "title": "budget, staffing, partnership, and risk"}, {"id": "164c4fe8-7501-499a-8535-a2e4bede7e37", "type": "concept", "title": "reach, fidelity, dose, adaptation, and sustainability"}]}, {"id": "940b9dec-2d5c-405a-a238-928c496b70bb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Evaluation and improvement", "description": "Uses credible evidence to learn, account for results, and improve.", "children": [{"id": "a37b59c0-f44a-410d-9066-60dd991f2466", "type": "concept", "title": "formative, process, outcome, and impact evaluation"}, {"id": "b662e44b-dde3-4691-b595-e471e25906ee", "type": "concept", "title": "quantitative, qualitative, and mixed methods"}, {"id": "456c480a-693d-481b-9198-09a84b18936d", "type": "concept", "title": "PDSA, visualization, dissemination, and action"}]}]}, {"id": "cc4811d6-a4b0-4a1e-a3a2-0cddf54b00a4", "type": "topic", "title": "Public Health Nursing Across Settings", "description": "Compares how population principles change across schools, workplaces, homes, corrections, and health agencies.", "children": [{"id": "df3a4ff7-2f43-4312-9845-8539bdbd426f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "School and adolescent health", "description": "Positions the school nurse between health, education, family, and community.", "children": [{"id": "b7f93d58-3feb-4d2b-b7a9-de36516edbba", "type": "concept", "title": "screening, immunization, chronic care, and emergency plans"}, {"id": "43c0835d-c4fb-43eb-baa9-31798b00b337", "type": "concept", "title": "mental and sexual health and safeguarding"}, {"id": "58b29ab5-ccf7-495c-9b0a-cd4b70f1f89c", "type": "concept", "title": "accessibility and family-school coordination"}]}, {"id": "6ff59d38-08d6-476f-badc-1420a9610cce", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Occupational health", "description": "Applies prevention and surveillance to worker health.", "children": [{"id": "86c9fa34-22b3-4389-ac6a-d508408139df", "type": "concept", "title": "hazard identification and exposure control"}, {"id": "86eca480-042a-4d5f-a303-087b14946ef2", "type": "concept", "title": "injury surveillance and return to work"}, {"id": "ab9dc8b2-b1e0-4b01-a5e3-eff7847ced78", "type": "concept", "title": "vaccination, respiratory protection, and wellness"}]}, {"id": "096b2fa5-62f6-4f9f-ad52-603c254500da", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Home, correctional, faith, and agency practice", "description": "Explores relationship-based practice in settings with distinct authority and resources.", "children": [{"id": "ade85ef7-4f26-4430-b7d9-ff9f402f07c0", "type": "concept", "title": "home visiting and family assessment"}, {"id": "904ec21d-fb75-4b31-b953-1d86a4649f31", "type": "concept", "title": "correctional health, re-entry, and continuity"}, {"id": "5cac916d-6a93-40cc-a65c-7e47d1bd6260", "type": "concept", "title": "faith/community organizations and health departments"}]}]}, {"id": "c9b464c5-8ca2-4f2c-b5b6-e227adce01f8", "type": "topic", "title": "Emergency Preparedness, Disaster Nursing, and Humanitarian Response", "description": "Prepares students for all emergency phases with attention to triage, continuity, equity, responder safety, and recovery.", "children": [{"id": "0a6326c5-f480-47b3-bef9-a151a346ad2f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Preparedness and incident management", "description": "Clarifies coordinated, all-hazards roles before an event.", "children": [{"id": "4c3f436c-6fce-47a5-aaa0-43351b012967", "type": "concept", "title": "hazard vulnerability and emergency plans"}, {"id": "dc8803a0-91b2-4145-bcd3-31575593f51d", "type": "concept", "title": "Incident Command System"}, {"id": "3ad16351-6397-494c-90f4-3d0e5046ade0",